@host = http://localhost:5238

### Submit a batch (send it twice: the second call returns the same batch with 200, not a new one)
POST {{host}}/batches
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: batch-2026-10-07-001

{
  "payments": [
    {
      "reference": "INV-1001",
      "amount": "1250.50",
      "currency": "USD",
      "beneficiaryName": "Acme Supplies Ltd",
      "beneficiaryAccount": "GB29NWBK60161331926819",
      "bankPartner": "BANK-A"
    },
    {
      "reference": "INV-1002",
      "amount": "980",
      "currency": "EUR",
      "beneficiaryName": "Globex GmbH",
      "beneficiaryAccount": "DE89370400440532013000",
      "bankPartner": "BANK-B"
    }
  ]
}

### Invalid batch: every problem is reported, nothing is saved
POST {{host}}/batches
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: batch-2026-10-07-002

{
  "payments": [
    { "reference": "INV-1", "amount": "10.005", "currency": "USD", "beneficiaryName": "Acme", "beneficiaryAccount": "123", "bankPartner": "BANK-A" },
    { "reference": "INV-1", "amount": "5", "currency": "USX", "beneficiaryName": "", "beneficiaryAccount": "123", "bankPartner": "BANK-A" }
  ]
}

### Batch showing every outcome (the simulated bank decides by the end of the account number)
### Wait a few seconds, then GET the batch: Submitted, Failed, Submitted after a lost reply, NeedsReview after 3 attempts
POST {{host}}/batches
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: batch-2026-10-07-003

{
  "payments": [
    { "reference": "INV-2001", "amount": "100.00", "currency": "USD", "beneficiaryName": "Accepts Ltd",   "beneficiaryAccount": "GB29NWBK60161331926819",   "bankPartner": "BANK-A" },
    { "reference": "INV-2002", "amount": "200.00", "currency": "USD", "beneficiaryName": "Closed Co",     "beneficiaryAccount": "GB00ACCOUNT-REJECT",       "bankPartner": "BANK-A" },
    { "reference": "INV-2003", "amount": "300.00", "currency": "USD", "beneficiaryName": "Lost Reply Inc","beneficiaryAccount": "GB00ACCOUNT-LOSTREPLY",    "bankPartner": "BANK-B" },
    { "reference": "INV-2004", "amount": "400.00", "currency": "USD", "beneficiaryName": "Silent Bank Co","beneficiaryAccount": "GB00ACCOUNT-TIMEOUT",      "bankPartner": "BANK-B" }
  ]
}

### Get a batch (paste the id from the first response)
GET {{host}}/batches/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
